    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "A Delta AirLines\nMAIN CABIN\nMENU",
      "A. Delta Air Lines\nSALAD\nRomaine garnished with\nDried Cherries, served with\nRaspberry Vinaigrette\nYOUR CHOICE OF ENTREE\nOmaha Steaks® Filet of Sirloin\nwith A.1. Savory Lemon Sauce,\naccompanied by Spinach\nMashed Potatoes and Sliced\nGreen Beans and Carrots\nTyson® Chicken Breast with\nMediterranean Sauce served\nover Vegetable Paella\nSunflower Grain Kaiser Roll\nDESSERT\nMango Mousse Cake\nWe apologize if any of the menu selections are not available.",
      "You DESERVE TO EXPERIENCE\nOMAHA STEAKS\nHand carved from the finest corn-fed\nbeef tenderloin, our deliciously mild and\ntender Filet Mignons will amaze you.\nYour satisfaction is 100% guaranteed.\nAnd remember, Omaha Steaks make a\nperfect gift... for\nany occasion.\n4 TENDER\n(6 oz.)\nFILET\nMIGNONS\nonly...\n$29.99\nreg. $52.99\nASK FOR ITEM #453DL\nOFFER VALID FOR 30 DAYS FROM TIME OF RECEIPT.\nPLUS 6 FREE (4 oz.)\nОмАна STEAKS BURGERS\nLimit 6 free burgers per customer.\nORDER ANYTIME TOLL FREE\n1-888-STEAK28\nwww.omahasteaks.com\nPREMIUM HEARTLAND QUALITY\nOMAHA STEAKS\nSINCE 1917\n© 1999 Omaha Creative Group, Inc.\nDJ2 SEP 2"
    ],
